  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Consumptive Intuition, Improved Transformation, Transformation, character level 5th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may exchange one or more traits granted by Improved Transformation for any other traits you would qualify for whenever you consume a creature’s brain. These traits must emulate abilities that the consumed creature possessed or that are associated with the creature, subject to GM discretion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
